## Command

```shell
biome lint --only=correctness/noUnresolvedImports valid.mjs missing.mjs
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{ "linter": { "rules": { "correctness": { "noUnresolvedImports": "error" } } } }
```

## `missing.mjs`

```mjs
import missing from 'missing'; console.log(missing);
```

## `node_modules/directory/lib/index.js`

```js
module.exports = { value: 1 };
```

## `node_modules/directory/package.json`

```json
{ "name": "directory", "main": "lib" }
```

## `node_modules/example/lib/index.js`

```js
module.exports = { value: 1 };
```

## `node_modules/example/package.json`

```json
{ "name": "example", "main": "lib/index.js" }
```

## `node_modules/extensionless/lib/index.js`

```js
